    "response": "GPS mode uses satellite positioning to follow a set path or hold a location, while attitude mode relies only on the aircraft\u2019s internal sensors to maintain a fixed attitude or heading without external positioning. GPS mode gives precise navigation; attitude mode is used when GPS is unavailable or for basic manual control.",
